OL,3,ATwo seriously injured after M20 crash
OL,4,Ainvolving more than 30 vehicles in Kent
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30 vehicles were involved in
OL,7,Fa collision which left two people
OL,8,Fseriously injured on the M20 in Kent
OL,9,Flate on Saturday, police say.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to the scene at
OL,12,Faround 18:41 on the London-bound
OL,13,Fcarriageway between junctions eight and
OL,14,Fnine, near Hollingbourne, Maidstone.
OL,16,FEleven people were cared for by
OL,17,Fparamedics and two taken to hospital,
OL,18,FKent Fire and Rescue Service said.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
