OL,3,ATwo seriously injured after M20 crash
OL,4,Ainvolving more than 30 vehicles in Kent
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn air ambulance crew, three fire
OL,7,Fengines and a "technical rescue unit"
OL,8,Fwere sent to the scene, where National
OL,9,FHighways said "thick fog" had been
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
